# Build-context hygiene for the images built with the repo root as context
# (compose `context: ..`: Dockerfile.traffic-oracle.gb10,
# Dockerfile.convoy-brain.gb10, Dockerfile.postgis.arm64). Without it the
# context was ~2.4 GB (venvs, node_modules) and agent session state (.mimosa)
# was baked into the oracle image. Services built from their own directory
# (command-deck, signal-ingress, event-emulator) are not affected by this file.
#
# Keep: models-local/t0/ (the oracle image bakes the t0 artifact).

# VCS, editors, agent/session state
.git
**/.mimosa
**/.claude
**/.idea
**/.vscode

# Python / Node / Rust build state
.venvs
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/node_modules
**/.svelte-kit
**/target

# Host runtime state and machine glue — never part of an image
.run-models
models
**/*.log

# Not used by any repo-root build
frontend
showcase
tests/artifacts
